Blue jean baby, L.A. lady

00:00:49.353 --> 00:00:51.815
Seamstress for the band

00:00:54.944 --> 00:00:59.825
Pretty-eyed, pirate smile

00:01:02.328 --> 00:01:05.290
You'll marry a music man

